 impact, which gives realistic bounce and takes strain off the backboard. It is built for dunking a light mini ball, not for hanging your body weight off — the whole set hooks over a door rather than bolting to a wall.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_q6":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"heading":"Can I Move It Between Rooms?","icon":"quiz","filled_icon":false,"row_content":"<p>Yes. It lifts off the door in seconds, so it can move between a bedroom, a living room, a dorm, or an office without any refitting.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_q1","collapsible_row_q2","collapsible_row_q3","collapsible_row_q4","collapsible_row_q5","collapsible_row_q6"],"custom_css":[".collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow {max-width: 100.4rem;}",".collapsible-none-layout details.accordion__details {background: #c7a3d1; color: #fff;}",".accordion .material-symbols-outlined {color: #fff;}",".accordion__title {color: #fff;}",".accordion.animate-item.animate-item--child.accordion--medium.accordion--top-border {margin-bottom: 15px;}",".accordion__details {padding: 0 10px;}"],"settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","caption":"","title":"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)","title_highlight_color":"#6d388b","heading_size":"h2","heading_alignment":"center","layout":"none","color_scheme":"background-1","container_color_scheme":"background-2","open_first_collapsible_row":false,"video_muted_autoplay":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","desktop_layout":"image_second","row_heading_size":"medium","collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_gradient_background":"","custom_colors_text":"#121212","custom_contaner_colors_background":"#ffffff","custom_container_gradient_background":"","custom_contaner_colors_text":"#121212"}},"b321ab88-2b59-4dba-bade-54885c874ca5":{"type":"section-divider","settings":{"visibility":"always-display","shape":"waves_3","flip_horizontal":false,"flip_vertica